\chapter{Derivation of Relativistic Mass Flux}

\section{Overview}
This appendix derives the mass flux equation used in Chapters 1–4.

\section{Derivation}
Jet power:
\begin{equation}
P = (\gamma - 1)\dot{m}c^2 \eta.
\end{equation}

Solving for $\dot{m}$:
\begin{equation}
\dot{m} = \frac{P}{(\gamma - 1)\eta c^2}.
\end{equation}

For the Mk-30:
\[
\dot{m} = 12.98~\text{g/s}.
\]

