\chapter{Numerical Stability Analysis}

\section{CFL Condition}
The CFL condition for RMHD:
\begin{equation}
\Delta t < \frac{\Delta x}{c + v_A},
\end{equation}
where $v_A$ is Alfvén speed.

For the Mk-30:
\[
v_A \approx 0.98c.
\]

\section{Divergence-Free Constraint}
Magnetic field divergence is controlled via:
\begin{equation}
\nabla \cdot \mathbf{B} = 0,
\end{equation}
enforced using constrained transport.

\section{AMR Stability}
Adaptive mesh refinement remains stable for:
\[
512^3~\text{cells}.
\]

Variance:
\[
< 10^{-12}.
\]

